@lang en
IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `tasco-nouns`

-- Fixtures for the tests modules: named fact patterns, no rules and no assertions. Every figure in
-- them is a scenario value chosen to sit on one side of a threshold the rules print; none is a
-- figure from a real policy.

§ `Fixtures`

§§ `Vehicles`

-- A private passenger car first registered in Vietnam in March 2022.
GIVETH A `A vehicle`
`a private car` MEANS
    `A vehicle` WITH
        `kind`                                         IS `a car`
        `group`                                        IS `a passenger car`
        `power`                                        IS `an engine only`
        `used for business`                            IS FALSE
        `imported after use abroad`                    IS FALSE
        `year of first registration in Vietnam`        IS 2022
        `month of first registration in Vietnam`       IS 3
        `year of manufacture`                          IS 2021
        `permitted load in tonnes`                     IS 0.5
        `permitted number of persons`                  IS 5
        `market value when the contract was concluded` IS 800000000

GIVETH A `A vehicle`
`the same car used for business` MEANS
    `A vehicle` WITH
        `kind`                                         IS `a car`
        `group`                                        IS `a passenger car`
        `power`                                        IS `an engine only`
        `used for business`                            IS TRUE
        `imported after use abroad`                    IS FALSE
        `year of first registration in Vietnam`        IS 2022
        `month of first registration in Vietnam`       IS 3
        `year of manufacture`                          IS 2021
        `permitted load in tonnes`                     IS 0.5
        `permitted number of persons`                  IS 5
        `market value when the contract was concluded` IS 800000000

-- A car imported after use abroad, made in 2015.
GIVETH A `A vehicle`
`a used import made in 2015` MEANS
    `A vehicle` WITH
        `kind`                                         IS `a car`
        `group`                                        IS `a passenger car`
        `power`                                        IS `an engine only`
        `used for business`                            IS FALSE
        `imported after use abroad`                    IS TRUE
        `year of first registration in Vietnam`        IS 2024
        `month of first registration in Vietnam`       IS 6
        `year of manufacture`                          IS 2015
        `permitted load in tonnes`                     IS 0.5
        `permitted number of persons`                  IS 5
        `market value when the contract was concluded` IS 400000000

-- A 10-tonne truck.
GIVETH A `A vehicle`
`a truck` MEANS
    `A vehicle` WITH
        `kind`                                         IS `a car`
        `group`                                        IS `a goods vehicle`
        `power`                                        IS `an engine only`
        `used for business`                            IS TRUE
        `imported after use abroad`                    IS FALSE
        `year of first registration in Vietnam`        IS 2020
        `month of first registration in Vietnam`       IS 1
        `year of manufacture`                          IS 2019
        `permitted load in tonnes`                     IS 10
        `permitted number of persons`                  IS 3
        `market value when the contract was concluded` IS 1200000000

-- A crane truck (Article 1.7.4).
GIVETH A `A vehicle`
`a crane truck` MEANS
    `A vehicle` WITH
        `kind`                                         IS `a car`
        `group`                                        IS `a special-purpose car`
        `power`                                        IS `an engine only`
        `used for business`                            IS TRUE
        `imported after use abroad`                    IS FALSE
        `year of first registration in Vietnam`        IS 2020
        `month of first registration in Vietnam`       IS 1
        `year of manufacture`                          IS 2019
        `permitted load in tonnes`                     IS 10
        `permitted number of persons`                  IS 5
        `market value when the contract was concluded` IS 2000000000

-- An electric car.
GIVETH A `A vehicle`
`an electric car` MEANS
    `A vehicle` WITH
        `kind`                                         IS `a car`
        `group`                                        IS `a passenger car`
        `power`                                        IS `electric, from the traction battery alone`
        `used for business`                            IS FALSE
        `imported after use abroad`                    IS FALSE
        `year of first registration in Vietnam`        IS 2024
        `month of first registration in Vietnam`       IS 5
        `year of manufacture`                          IS 2024
        `permitted load in tonnes`                     IS 0.5
        `permitted number of persons`                  IS 5
        `market value when the contract was concluded` IS 900000000

§§ `Policies`

-- A one-year policy concluded on 10 January 2025, period 10 January 2025 to 9 January 2026,
-- with all four covers and whatever additional clauses are passed in. Own damage 600 million on a
-- car worth 800 million (under-insured), no deductible on the policy; accident 100 million per
-- person for 5 persons; goods 50 million a tonne with a limit of 500 million; third party 100
-- million each head.
GIVEN `the vehicle`         IS A `A vehicle`
      `own-damage sum`      IS A NUMBER
      `accident sum`        IS A NUMBER
      `the clauses`         IS A LIST OF `An additional clause on the policy`
GIVETH A `A policy`
`a policy on` `the vehicle` `, own damage` `own-damage sum` `, accident` `accident sum` `, clauses` `the clauses` MEANS
    `A policy` WITH
        `the vehicle`                      IS `the vehicle`
        `date of conclusion`               IS YMD 2025 1 10
        `start of the period of insurance` IS YMD 2025 1 10
        `end of the period of insurance`   IS YMD 2026 1 9
        `application signed`               IS TRUE
        `premium paid in full and on time` IS TRUE
        `premium before tax`               IS 12000000
        `own damage`                       IS JUST (`An own-damage section` WITH `sum insured` IS `own-damage sum`, `deductible stated on the policy` IS NOTHING)
        `driver and passenger accident`    IS JUST (`An accident section` WITH `sum insured per person per accident` IS `accident sum`, `number of persons insured` IS 5)
        `goods liability`                  IS JUST (`A goods section` WITH `sum insured per tonne` IS 50000000, `total limit of liability` IS 500000000)
        `voluntary third-party liability`  IS JUST (`A third-party section` WITH `voluntary limit for bodily injury per person per accident` IS 100000000, `voluntary limit for property per accident` IS 100000000)
        `additional clauses`               IS `the clauses`
        `countries named for BS05`         IS LIST "Laos"
        `added equipment listed`           IS EMPTY

GIVETH A `A policy`
`the standard policy` MEANS `a policy on` `a private car` `, own damage` 600000000 `, accident` 100000000 `, clauses` EMPTY

GIVETH A `A policy`
`a policy concluded before the rules took effect` MEANS
    `A policy` WITH
        `the vehicle`                      IS `a private car`
        `date of conclusion`               IS YMD 2024 11 14
        `start of the period of insurance` IS YMD 2024 11 14
        `end of the period of insurance`   IS YMD 2025 11 13
        `application signed`               IS TRUE
        `premium paid in full and on time` IS TRUE
        `premium before tax`               IS 12000000
        `own damage`                       IS JUST (`An own-damage section` WITH `sum insured` IS 600000000, `deductible stated on the policy` IS NOTHING)
        `driver and passenger accident`    IS NOTHING
        `goods liability`                  IS NOTHING
        `voluntary third-party liability`  IS NOTHING
        `additional clauses`               IS EMPTY
        `countries named for BS05`         IS EMPTY
        `added equipment listed`           IS EMPTY

GIVETH A `A policy`
`a policy with the premium unpaid` MEANS
    `A policy` WITH
        `the vehicle`                      IS `a private car`
        `date of conclusion`               IS YMD 2025 1 10
        `start of the period of insurance` IS YMD 2025 1 10
        `end of the period of insurance`   IS YMD 2026 1 9
        `application signed`               IS FALSE
        `premium paid in full and on time` IS FALSE
        `premium before tax`               IS 12000000
        `own damage`                       IS JUST (`An own-damage section` WITH `sum insured` IS 600000000, `deductible stated on the policy` IS NOTHING)
        `driver and passenger accident`    IS NOTHING
        `goods liability`                  IS NOTHING
        `voluntary third-party liability`  IS NOTHING
        `additional clauses`               IS EMPTY
        `countries named for BS05`         IS EMPTY
        `added equipment listed`           IS EMPTY

-- An additional clause accepted in writing, premium paid, running with the whole period.
GIVEN `the code` IS AN `An additional clause`
GIVETH AN `An additional clause on the policy`
`the clause` `the code` MEANS
    `An additional clause on the policy` WITH
        `code`                                  IS `the code`
        `accepted in writing with premium paid` IS TRUE
        `start`                                 IS YMD 2025 1 10
        `end`                                   IS YMD 2026 1 9

§§ `Circumstances`

-- Generated by scratchpad/vn17/fixtures_gen.py: one clean record (a loss on 15 June 2025, in
-- Vietnam, every Article 10 fact clean, 4 persons on board, 50 km/h in a 60 zone) and variants
-- that each change the fields named in their own names.
GIVETH A `The circumstances`
`clean circumstances` MEANS
    `The circumstances` WITH
        `date of the loss`                                                                       IS YMD 2025 6 15
        `in Vietnam`                                                                             IS TRUE
        `country`                                                                                IS "Vietnam"
        `war or terrorism`                                                                       IS FALSE
        `deliberate destruction by the policyholder, owner, driver or another interested person` IS FALSE
        `valid inspection certificate`                                                           IS TRUE
        `modifications`                                                                          IS EMPTY
        `vehicle in operation`                                                                   IS TRUE
        `vehicle in traffic`                                                                     IS TRUE
        `driver of the age the Road Traffic Law requires`                                        IS TRUE
        `driving licence`                                                                        IS `a valid licence for this vehicle`
        `special equipment operated without a required licence`                                  IS FALSE
        `blood alcohol, mg per 100 ml`                                                           IS NOTHING
        `breath alcohol, mg per litre`                                                           IS NOTHING
        `drugs or prohibited stimulants used`                                                    IS FALSE
        `traffic offences`                                                                       IS EMPTY
        `prohibited uses`                                                                        IS EMPTY
        `load carried in tonnes`                                                                 IS 0
        `persons carried, not counting children under 7`                                         IS 4
        `speed`                                                                                  IS 50
        `speed limit`                                                                            IS 60
        `force majeure or objective obstacle, in days`                                           IS 0

